      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUCKLE UP ARLO (1) still a maiden after 13 runs but rarely out of the placings. Was in the placings again last time finishing third (30.39) at Launceston. The form from his last run stacks up well. Can measure up this time. MAGGIE'S DELIGHT (2) finished second (16.55) two back at Launceston but out of the placings last time when 8th at this track. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. MISS SUE LEE (3) is a eight start maiden who has placed three times, the latest finishing in the minor money again when third at this track. Gave a big sight last time racing on speed much of the way. Can measure up. ENYO DANGER (7) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
